   "source": [
    "### Album overlap across users\n",
    "\n",
    "Most albums are associated with very few users: the median album appears for only one user, while 90% of albums appear for no more than two users.\n",
    "\n",
    "However, the upper tail contains albums with substantially more cross-user interaction, with the top 1% appearing for at least 11 users. This confirms that the catalogue is highly sparse, but still contains a sizeable subset of shared albums that can support collaborative filtering."
