  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "315c355b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Choosing lower filtering thresholds\n",
    "\n",
    "A large proportion of users have enough history to support personalised recommendations: around 71% have interacted with at least 5 albums, while 54% have interacted with at least 10.\n",
    "\n",
    "The album side is much sparser. Only 17.1% of albums are shared by at least two users, falling to 3.4% for at least five users and 1.2% for at least ten.\n",
    "\n",
    "To retain as much useful data as possible while still requiring some cross-user overlap, I will use an initial lower threshold of **5 albums per user** and **2 users per album**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "83879843",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "MIN_ALBUMS_PER_USER = 5\n",
    "MIN_USERS_PER_ALBUM = 2\n",
    "MAX_ALBUMS_PER_USER = 2000"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b845098e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Max albums per user is 2000 in order to remove extreme tail without throwing away meaningful data.\n",
    "\n",
    "Total listen count will not be used yet as an upper filter since evidence for extreme album breadth is stronger."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a4089d8f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Filter and validate interactions\n",
    "\n",
    "Filtering users changes the number of users associated with each album, while filtering albums changes the number of albums associated with each user.\n",
    "\n",
    "The two thresholds are therefore applied repeatedly until no further interactions are removed. I then validate the resulting dataset to confirm that all remaining users and albums satisfy the chosen requirements."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "id": "5a6ece54",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "eligible_users = albums_per_user[\n",
    "    (albums_per_user >= MIN_ALBUMS_PER_USER)\n",
    "    & (albums_per_user <= MAX_ALBUMS_PER_USER)\n",
    "].index\n",
    "\n",
    "eligible_albums = users_per_album[\n",
    "    users_per_album >= MIN_USERS_PER_ALBUM\n",
    "].index\n",
    "\n",
    "filtered_interactions = user_album_interactions[\n",
    "    user_album_interactions[\"user_id\"].isin(eligible_users)\n",
    "    & user_album_interactions[\"album_key\"].isin(eligible_albums)\n",
