    "### Validate filtering consistency\n",
    "\n",
    "After the initial one-pass filter, some users fall below the minimum of 5 albums and some albums fall below the minimum of 2 users. This happens because removing sparse albums can reduce a user's remaining history, while removing users can also reduce the number of listeners associated with an album.\n",
    "\n",
    "To ensure that all remaining users and albums satisfy the chosen thresholds, the filtering process is therefore repeated iteratively until the dataset stabilises."
